<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK APR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.68 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK APR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.68 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.68 billion markka .</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for April 24		   12,300</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for April	    6,334</p>
<p> Average reserves to April 21			 6,188</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,682</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
